    {
      "text": "Forest plot (Figure B) of TB detection by the FluoroType MTB assay for 6 studies, listing TP, FP, FN and TN counts with sensitivity and specificity (95% CI) and plots on a 0–1 scale. Sensitivity ranges from 0.87 to 0.95; specificity is 0.94–1.00 except Obasanya 2017 (0.60).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
